{"reviews":[{"id":"B00H71UXFC-0","r":3.0,"t":"Great Quality but VERY Large","x":"I was really excited to get this product. I have been wanting a body chain to wear with my bikinis for a long time. It was made well and brand new but it's so large. No matter what configuration I put this chain on it hangs down to my knees!!! I am 5'3 and 110 lbs so I realize I am tiny but goodness to my knees? It must only fit someone 5'10 or taller.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-1","r":5.0,"t":"So I got this product super fast and was really excited","x":"Hey ladies.  So I got this product super fast and was really excited! Put it on and it was just what I wanted!  I brought it to my friends house and she took it and put it on (in a completely different way) and complained it was HUGE.  I think you're putting it on wrong if you say it's hanging to your knees.  I put it on like a jacket- one loop on each arm.  She put it on over her head and un-clasped it and secured the other around her waist.  Just a helpful tip!!!  Would hate for anyone to wast","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-2","r":1.0,"t":"too sensative","x":"once I received it, I opened it at it broke. I was very upset. I want to buy another but don't want to wait a month for it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-3","r":1.0,"t":"Incredibly long","x":"In the photo, the chain meets before the navel. The chain I received is far much longer than that..disappointing :(","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-4","r":1.0,"t":"Bad","x":"I do not recommend this product , mine fell apart instantly I didn't even get to wear it for 2 hours, it's way to long it looks ridiculous so I had to tie it up with a small hair tie and it smells like tarnished jewelry .","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-5","r":1.0,"t":"Thumbs down","x":"It's way too big to even wear. I tried to double it up so it'd work but there's no way.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-6","r":2.0,"t":"not impressed","x":"I ordered this thinking it would fit since the pictures shows a small figured woman wearing it.  Clearly false advertising because this piece of jewelry is so large it hangs to my knees...ridiculous!!  I should have gone to hobby lobby and made my own.  You can reconfigure it to fit but it is not worth the buy or the wait time.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-7","r":1.0,"t":"Not true to size","x":"When i got this item it was abolutely huge and too long. Looks nothing like the picture and i'm disapointed","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-8","r":5.0,"t":"Cute but too long","x":"Nice but a little too long. You can cut it and make it shorter though. It's a little thicker than it looks","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-9","r":4.0,"t":"Great for your buck!","x":"I've worn this piece a few times, and I really like it. The only downside to this piece is that it is not long enough. The chains do not go all the way down to the wait as it is in depicted in the picture. But, they more so stop mid torso from the waistline to the breast. I have worn this item in the water and it has not turned any colors, or irritated the skin--which is a definite plus considering the item is so inexpensive.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-10","r":4.0,"t":"Very long chain Super Adjustable","x":"This necklace is very adjustable. Too adjustable! It's impossible to distinguish which side is the top versus waist part. That being said, it's super adjustable! I just put mine on and adjusted the clasps where I wanted them, and broke off the extra chain. There is a lot of extra chain so that worked well. Very pretty gold chain. Not incredibly durable but for this type of thing- great price and great product!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2015"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-11","r":4.0,"t":"lucky and happy that my friend likes it","x":"Guess I was lucky before i bought this I was hoping that the necklace waist belt was really long enough to fit into the height of my friend, and i am glad that it did. and my friend liked it, I wanted to give this a five star but i think it would be better if you can order different sizes .","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-12","r":4.0,"t":"Love it !","x":"I haven't worn it yet bc I'm waiting for the summer to wear it with my bathing suit . But I did however try it on and it's a little big on me , but I'm sure I can make it work . Other than that , it's cute and I really like it .","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-13","r":5.0,"t":"Increase your tips!","x":"Getting way more tips at work when I wear this chain. Wish it wouldn't rip off my belly piercing every time I glide down the pole upside-down. Con: tramp stamp gets itchy from the chain rubbing on it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2015"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-14","r":5.0,"t":"I love it","x":"I purchased two of this product, one for myself and the other is a gift. Both were new and very cute. I love how the gold is shine and the material is very good. It is attractive and sexy.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-15","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn't fit","x":"Maybe I'm too tall for it, i don't know but this chain does not fit me the way it fits the girl in the photo. Not at all. Maybe mine was made wrong. I'm very dissatisfied with my purchase!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-16","r":3.0,"t":"body chain","x":"Gets the job done If your looking for body jewelry- great price took alittle while to recieve but sexy under bathing suit or a crop top - pretty much any occasion - I would recommend","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-17","r":5.0,"t":"body necklace","x":"cute............looks just like the photo, had a hard time figuring how to wear it so I type body necklace image search in google..lol, or tpye in amazon search","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-18","r":1.0,"t":"Definitely not happy with my purchase and I would never buy it ...","x":"This broke within 5 minutes of wearing it. Definitely not happy with my purchase and I would never buy it ever again. Extremely dissatisfied. DON'T BUY!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-19","r":1.0,"t":"you get what you pay for","x":"it's really big so I had to take of a few inches of loops with pliers. Broke the first day I wore it :( and the color comes off/turns you green.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2015"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-20","r":5.0,"t":"ust be careful with it and it will be perfect for the summer","x":"I have had this for a long time and it hasnt turned color or been broken. ust be careful with it and it will be perfect for the summer!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-21","r":5.0,"t":"Love this look but when it came in the mail ...","x":"Love this look but when it came in the mail it was super confusing to put on and it was too big for me and i'm a size 0-2.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-22","r":3.0,"t":"Not as light as I thought","x":"From the picture I thought it would be light but when I got the chain it's heavy...it's wearable but it could be lighter","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-23","r":1.0,"t":"I ordered this and should of expected from the low ...","x":"I ordered this and should of expected from the low price that it would never come. Really annoys me that this happened.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2014"},{"id":"B00H71UXFC-24","r":2.0,"t":"Pretty Good While It Lasted","x":"Pretty Good While It Lasted. I got in the pool & it fell apart. I probably could have fixed it. But I didn't bother.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many customers find the chain far too large or long, often hanging down to the knees or not matching the photos.","cites":[1,4,5,6,7,8]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the item breaking or falling apart almost immediately.","cites":[3,5]},{"text":"Some customers say it is adjustable and can be shortened or reconfigured to fit.","cites":[2,9,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers note sizing issues in the opposite direction, saying it is too short or wish different sizes were offered.","cites":[10,12]},{"text":"Positive reviewers describe it as cute, well-made, shiny, and attractive.","cites":[2,13,15]}]},"qa":[]}